{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a YouTuber who seeks out horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While searching for the next big hit and exploring various haunted locations, you find yourself in a mysterious space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An open elevator in front of you seems to be calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625360/extras/InfoScreen.png?t=1744705309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faced with phenomena you've never seen before, you sense this could be your breakthrough moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, alongside the excitement, a creeping fear arises\u2014can you really escape from this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not trust your eyes. The world you see with your eyes and the world through the camera are not the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Framed Fear&quot; is a horror game where you must escape from an unknown space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By identifying the differences between what you see with your eyes and what the camera captures, you must distinguish fake floors and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game does not have a mid-save function, and clearing it requires experiencing all paranormal occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While it is a horror game, there are no uncomfortable jump scares, and the estimated playtime is around 60 to 120 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625360?t=1744705309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625360?t=1744705309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625360/d999996e3a3d1c0d1528fb812811abf08e0d428d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744705309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625360/d999996e3a3d1c0d1528fb812811abf08e0d428d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744705309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a YouTuber who seeks out horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While searching for the next big hit and exploring various haunted locations, you find yourself in a mysterious space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An open elevator in front of you seems to be calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625360/extras/InfoScreen.png?t=1744705309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faced with phenomena you've never seen before, you sense this could be your breakthrough moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, alongside the excitement, a creeping fear arises\u2014can you really escape from this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not trust your eyes. The world you see with your eyes and the world through the camera are not the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Framed Fear&quot; is a horror game where you must escape from an unknown space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By identifying the differences between what you see with your eyes and what the camera captures, you must distinguish fake floors and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game does not have a mid-save function, and clearing it requires experiencing all paranormal occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While it is a horror game, there are no uncomfortable jump scares, and the estimated playtime is around 60 to 120 minutes.</p>","developers":["HunGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625360/fa830019fb73a17967658776366fd7f9aae1667a/header.jpg?t=1744705309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_req